# Files consumed by Linux (containers, the Ubuntu host) must never pick up CRLF
# from a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true: a CRLF shebang makes bash
# unfindable ("/usr/bin/env: bash\r: No such file or directory") and nginx and
# PHP-FPM refuse their configuration. Found when the Docker parity stack
# crash-looped on a fresh Windows checkout (2026-09-07, pre-server hardening).
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.cnf text eol=lf
*.ini text eol=lf
.env.docker text eol=lf
deploy/** text eol=lf
docker/** text eol=lf
